            "fieldKind": "mail_ballot_request_deadline",
            "text": "Clerks & Voters – Voters, family members, authorized persons or health care providers may request early or absentee ballots until 5:00 p.m. or the closing of the town clerk's office on this day. If the clerk does not have office hours on the day before the election, then absentee requests may be filed until the closing of the clerk’s office on the last day the office has hours prior to the election.",
            "quote": "November 2 (Monday)\nClerks & Voters – Voters, family members, authorized persons or health care providers may request early or absentee ballots until 5:00 p.m. or the closing of the town clerk's office on this day. If the clerk does not have office hours on the day before the election, then absentee requests may be filed until the closing of the clerk’s office on the last day the office has hours prior to the election.",
